README for creating new Linux targets.

Start the new-target.ini which uses the cadet01/ubuntu24 image, and
login with mike/mike.  Add an ip address :

   ip addr add 10.0.0.140/24 dev ens25
   ip link set ens25 up

And from simics
   run-script real-net.simics

You can the scp files to the new target server 
   scp -P 4022 somefile localhost:/some/place

Alternately, you can use the simics-agent and the sample driver-script.sh
to move files onto the target and set the target's IP address.
   Uncomment the PRE_INIT_SCRIPT entry in the new-target.ini
   Revise the driver-script.sh to move the files you wish to move


When done, use the save-persistent-state and bin/checkpoint-merge to create a new
craff for your target.

